                J/Shift    - Youtube: Faster Rewind (J)
                L          - Youtube: Fast Forward
                Shift      - compatibilyty for Scrensot Shortcuts & moving Tabs to N-th Desktop.
            */

            bindings = <
&kp LEFT_ARROW        &none             &none              &kp RIGHT_ARROW   &none       &kp KP_PLUS  &kp N7        &kp N8        &kp N9  &kp KP_MULTIPLY
&mt LEFT_SHIFT J      &kp C_PREVIOUS    &kp C_VOLUME_DOWN  &kp C_VOLUME_UP   &kp C_NEXT  &kp L        &kp KP_MINUS  &kp NUMBER_4  &kp N5  &kp N6           &kp KP_DIVIDE
